{
  "page": 447,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3813,
      "text": "\"Mengapa kamu tidak tolong-menolong?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3814,
      "text": "Bahkan mereka pada hari itu menyerah (kepada keputusan Allah).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3815,
      "text": "Dan sebagian mereka menghadap kepada sebagian yang lain saling berbantah-bantahan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3816,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya (pengikut-pengikut) mereka berkata (kepada pemimpin-pemimpin mereka), \"Kamulah yang dahulu datang kepada kami dari kanan.\"[728]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3817,
      "text": "(Pemimpin-pemimpin) mereka menjawab, \"(Tidak), bahkan kamulah yang tidak (mau) menjadi orang mukmin,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3818,
      "text": "sedangkan kami tidak berkuasa terhadapmu, bahkan kamu menjadi kaum yang melampaui batas.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3819,
      "text": "Maka pantas putusan (azab) Tuhan menimpa kita; pasti kita akan merasakan (azab itu).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3820,
      "text": "Maka kami telah menyesatkan kamu, sesungguhnya kami sendiri, orang-orang yang sesat.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3821,
      "text": "Maka sesunguhnya mereka pada hari itu bersama-sama merasakan azab.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3822,
      "text": "Sungguh, demikianlah Kami memperlakukan terhadap orang-orang yang berbuat dosa.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3823,
      "text": "Sungguh, dahulu apabila dikatakan kepada mereka, \"Lā ilāha illallāh\" (Tidak ada tuhan yang berhak disembah selain Allah), mereka menyombongkan diri,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3824,
      "text": "dan mereka berkata, \"Apakah kami harus meninggalkan sesembahan kami karena seorang penyair gila?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3825,
      "text": "Padahal dia (Muhammad) datang dengan membawa kebenaran dan membenarkan rasul-rasul (sebelumnya).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3826,
      "text": "Sungguh, kamu pasti akan merasakan azab yang pedih.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3827,
      "text": "Dan kamu tidak diberi balasan melainkan terhadap apa yang telah kamu kerjakan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3828,
      "text": "tetapi hamba-hamba Allah yang dibersihkan (dari dosa),",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3829,
      "text": "mereka itu memperoleh rezeki yang sudah ditentukan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3830,
      "text": "(yaitu) buah-buahan. Dan mereka orang yang dimuliakan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3831,
      "text": "di dalam surga-surga yang penuh kenikmatan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3832,
      "text": "(mereka duduk) berhadap-hadapan di atas dipan-dipan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3833,
      "text": "Kepada mereka diedarkan gelas (yang berisi air) dari mata air (surga),",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3834,
      "text": "(warnanya) putih bersih, sedap rasanya bagi orang-orang yang minum.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3835,
      "text": "Tidak ada di dalamnya (unsur) yang memabukkan dan mereka tidak mabuk karenanya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3836,
      "text": "Dan di sisi mereka ada (bidadari-bidadari) yang bermata indah, dan membatasi pandangannya,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3837,
      "text": "seakan-akan mereka adalah telur yang tersimpan dengan baik.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3838,
      "text": "Lalu mereka berhadap-hadapan satu sama lain sambil bercakap-cakap.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3839,
      "text": "Berkatalah salah seorang di antara mereka, \"Sesungguhnya aku dahulu (di dunia) pernah mempunyai seorang teman,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 447,
      "ruku": 387,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
